    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the creators of the award-winning <strong><i>'The Life and Suffering of Sir Brante'</i></strong>\u00a0comes a new kind of role-playing experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855850/extras/6b5abd2d815dd01ce040ebae854b8a26.avif?t=1755684149\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>'Agent of Strange'</i> </strong>is set in<strong> an old and remote wintry European city</strong> sealed off from the world \u2013 a place of shadows, secrets, and power plays. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You pretend to be an ordinary citizen: but you are a covert agent of the Conspiracy who infiltrated the City and dismantles the hidden regime of the monstrous Traum Family from within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855850/extras/6291236e467a3ed483a07f61ba984f5e.poster.avif?t=1755684149\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855850/extras/6291236e467a3ed483a07f61ba984f5e.webm?t=1755684149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855850/extras/6291236e467a3ed483a07f61ba984f5e.mp4?t=1755684149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855850/extras/7d1f9c66f9601b2af05dbef4e06964db.avif?t=1755684149\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You will explore a handcrafted early 20th-century city</strong> filled with urban mysteries and occult lore, surreal locations, and nightmarish beauty. Once a haven for scientists, mystics, and exiles, it has now been taken over by a  clan of aristocrats who walked through a forbidden passage \u2013 the Red Door \u2013 and came back\u2026 changed. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now they establish their occult reign all over the City, impose deviant laws, and erase anyone who opposes them.  <br>They have a Plan. But what it truly is?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855850/extras/43facb1d12f5ae8d6a6e698a7943afe0.poster.avif?t=1755684149\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855850/extras/43facb1d12f5ae8d6a6e698a7943afe0.webm?t=1755684149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855850/extras/43facb1d12f5ae8d6a6e698a7943afe0.mp4?t=1755684149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855850/extras/baf8898d45b0a28bb1aafd31ce14cce9.avif?t=1755684149\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You create your own Conspirator </strong>\u2014 their traits, appearance, background, social class and even secret motives.<br>As an undercover agent,<strong> </strong>you must blend in the City\u2019s life. Choose your cover as an ordinary civilian: clerk, student or factory worker.   <br>The Conspiracy doesn\u2019t give you orders \u2013 it gives you choices. You decide who to be, what path to take, and what mask to wear. Upstanding citizen or outlaw, soldier or occultist, aristocrat or lowlife, leader or loner, traitor\u2026 or something far darker. Who will <i><strong>you</strong></i><strong> </strong>become?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855850/extras/4808394d4db078f634970be5300741f4.poster.avif?t=1755684149\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855850/extras/4808394d4db078f634970be5300741f4.webm?t=1755684149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855850/extras/4808394d4db078f634970be5300741f4.mp4?t=1755684149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855850/extras/3abd7087aad9071ff420548121e79686.avif?t=1755684149\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>At the heart of <i>Agent of Strange</i> is a sandbox narrative system </strong>where you are free to move through the story in your own way. You choose which actions to take, which missions to pursue, whom to trust, when and where things will happen. Your every encounter is open-ended. No two playthroughs will be the same.<br>Carve your unique path through the darkest days of the City and build the Conspiracy of your own!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855850/extras/385bf59b2aa06dd291c1fdafe749b31c.poster.avif?t=1755684149\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855850/extras/385bf59b2aa06dd291c1fdafe749b31c.webm?t=1755684149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855850/extras/385bf59b2aa06dd291c1fdafe749b31c.mp4?t=1755684149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855850/extras/ed237e4afdd5d88f668ed842321b3cab.avif?t=1755684149\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You live and act in society \u2014 and your survival depends on it.</strong> The City reacts to your actions and choices. Its people have lives, loyalties, and agendas of their own. You are never alone \u2014 always mind what you are saying and to whom\u2026 or be caught. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time passes. Events unfold. And every failure leaves a mark on you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855850/extras/c242d571e3560a5298934680bfd5e93c.poster.avif?t=1755684149\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855850/extras/c242d571e3560a5298934680bfd5e93c.webm?t=1755684149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855850/extras/c242d571e3560a5298934680bfd5e93c.mp4?t=1755684149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855850/extras/ed15401c5ef4ab3e5ec7befc21a9e642.avif?t=1755684149\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Conspirator\u2019s task is a hard one. You will stand against the forces much more powerful than you. Lead the Conspiracy to victory \u2014 or be erased from existence.<br>To endure, you\u2019ll gather forbidden knowledge, make plans with other conspirators, and dive into mysteries so deep they will change what you know about the world. And the most terrifying dangers await not your mortal body, but your soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The City is broken. Will it break you as well? Or will you be the one to piece it back together?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the creators of the award-winning <strong><i>'The Life and Suffering of Sir Brante'</i></strong>\u00a0comes a new kind of role-playing experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855850/extras/6b5abd2d815dd01ce040ebae854b8a26.avif?t=1755684149\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>'Agent of Strange'</i> </strong>is set in<strong> an old and remote wintry European city</strong> sealed off from the world \u2013 a place of shadows, secrets, and power plays. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You pretend to be an ordinary citizen: but you are a covert agent of the Conspiracy who infiltrated the City and dismantles the hidden regime of the monstrous Traum Family from within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855850/extras/6291236e467a3ed483a07f61ba984f5e.poster.avif?t=1755684149\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855850/extras/6291236e467a3ed483a07f61ba984f5e.webm?t=1755684149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855850/extras/6291236e467a3ed483a07f61ba984f5e.mp4?t=1755684149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855850/extras/7d1f9c66f9601b2af05dbef4e06964db.avif?t=1755684149\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You will explore a handcrafted early 20th-century city</strong> filled with urban mysteries and occult lore, surreal locations, and nightmarish beauty. Once a haven for scienti